    "live_births_agg": "POP201A has SEX+RESIDENCE split, no Total row. SUM of all rows gives total live births.",
    "birth_death_rate_note": "POP202A/POP207A rate datasets only have Urban/Rural split. AVG of both is used as an approximation; absolute counts (POP201A/POP206B) are preferred where available."
